le","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can update a shape source by setting its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shape"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Data source for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSource","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". This protocol defines two optional methods for fetching","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data, one based on tile coordinates, and one based on a bounding box. Classes that implement this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"protocol must implement one, and only one of the methods. Methods on this protocol will not be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"called on main thread, they will be called on the caller’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestQueue"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlncomputedshapesourcedatasource","kind":"symbol","title":"MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNComputedShapeSourceDataSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"title":"MLNShape","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overla